'''Mega Cat EX''' (メガにゃんこEX ''Mega Nyanko EX'') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in [[Cabaret Cat Awakens!]]. It was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Mega Cat EX
|image = E 296.png
|appearance = [[Cabaret Cat Awakens!]]
|money drop = 9,999¢ - 39,496¢
}}

==Enemy==
Mega Cat EX is similar to [[Mega Cat (Enemy)|Mega Cat]] in terms of stats, but Mega Cat EX is a lot more effective in the battleground. They have the same attack animation length, speed, knockbacks and attack power, but EX has a shorter delay between attacks, more health, longer range and (in consequence) higher DPS.

==Strategy==
Mega Cat EX retains the [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] trait, so fast attacking units such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and its [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|crazed form]] or [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] may be needed to defeat it.

It supports [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]], [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] and [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies in the stages it appears in, purely rush units, you have to prevent its advance at all costs, which will be more difficult due to its overall stats improvement.

